\n\nふふふ～、凄いでしょ～！　え、二刀流の理由～？\nこの力はね～、大昔の皇帝さんの\n逸話から賜ったの～。劉備さんっていって～、\n成都に陵墓がある、大英雄なのよ～？","welcome":"は～い、どなた様ですか～？\nあれあれ～、初めましてのかた～？\nふ～ん……『との』さんかぁ～。変わった名前の子ね～！\nお姉さんは蓉城っていうの～、よろしくねぇ～♪","raw":{"CardID":833,"ClassID":1100,"Rarity":7,"Tokusei1":26,"VoiceID":789,"AreaType":12,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":110,"AttackCorrection":134,"DefenseCorrection":116,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":3,"GrowUpLimitType":999,"AbilityID":9833,"GimmickID":833,"SpecialAttackID":833,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"MaxRenovationCount":1,"RenovationType":5,"Renovation1AbilityID":10833,"Renovation1GimmickID":9833,"Renovation1SpecialAttackID":9833,"AutoProtect":1}}